{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":154,"count":26,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L01-1-08\",\"可爱\",\"可愛\",\"可爱\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"新同學很可愛。","pinyin":"Xīn tóngxué hěn kěài.","english":"The new classmate is lovely.","sourceCardId":"B1L01-1-08","sourceFront":"可愛","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"她是新同學，叫友美。她很可愛。","pinyin":"Tā shì xīn tóngxué, jiào Yǒuměi. Tā hěn kěài.","english":"She is our new classmate. Her name is Youmei. She is cute.","sourceCardId":"B1L01-1-01","sourceFront":"新","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"很可愛，友美喜歡可愛的東西。","pinyin":"Hěn kěài. Yǒuměi xǐhuān kěài de dōngxi.","english":"It’s very cute. Youmei likes cute stuff.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-01","sourceFront":"這","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"燈籠上的小老虎好可愛。","pinyin":"Dēnglóng shàng de xiǎo lǎohǔ hǎo kě'ài.","english":"The little tiger on the lantern is so lovely.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L11-1-10\",\"聊天兒\",\"聊天（兒）\",\"聊天（儿）\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他說話很有趣，所以每個人都喜歡跟他聊天。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L11-1-10","sourceFront":"聊天兒","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我跟朋友聊天，聊得很愉快。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-1-13","sourceFront":"愉快","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個外國學生常跟台灣朋友聊天，用中文表達自己的意見。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-2-11","sourceFront":"表達","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個外國學生常跟台灣朋友聊天，用中文表達自己的意見。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-2-12","sourceFront":"意見","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了練習英文的聽力和會話，我每天都跟美國朋友聊天。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-11","sourceFront":"會話","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我喜歡週末跟家人聚在一起吃飯、聊天。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-15","sourceFront":"聚","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"昨天小康碰到一位好久不見的老朋友，他們聊天聊到很晚才回家。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-22","sourceFront":"碰到","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小陳很孝順，每個週末都去安養院陪父親聊天、散步，一點兒都不覺得辛苦","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-23","sourceFront":"孝順","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"張先生的個性很活潑、說話很幽默，跟他聊天總是很愉快。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-22","sourceFront":"幽默","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"父母要經常陪孩子聊天、玩遊戲，給零用錢不能完全滿足孩子的需要。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-25","sourceFront":"需要","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"跟張先生聊天時，總是我問一句，他答一句，真沒意思。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-12","sourceFront":"句","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他不管我忙不忙，老是黏著我聊天，讓我覺得有點煩。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-40","sourceFront":"黏","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"聊(chat) + 天(day) + 兒(-r suffix) → 聊天兒 is to chat."},{"key":"[\"B1L11-3-08\",\"照相\",\"照相\",\"照相\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我去年去看了，很多大人帶著小孩去看燈會，非常熱鬧，我照了很多相片。","pinyin":"Wǒ qùnián qù kàn le, hěn duō dàrén dài zhe xiǎohái qù kàn dēnghuì, fēicháng rènào, wǒ zhào le hěn duō xiàngpiàn.","english":"Last year I went to see the Carnival. Many adults brought their children to see the Lantern Carnival, and it was very lively. I took a lot of photos.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"照(shine) + 相(photo) → shining light to capture a photo: 照相 means 'to take a photo'."},{"key":"[\"B1L12-3-04\",\"母親\",\"母親\",\"母亲\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我的母親常對我說：「你要多看書，少玩手機。」","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L12-3-04","sourceFront":"母親","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我父親的職業是大學教授，母親在郵局上班。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-02","sourceFront":"職業","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"母親節那天，我親自做了一個大蛋糕，送給最親愛的媽媽。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-02","sourceFront":"親愛","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"母親為家人親手織了幾件毛衣，希望讓大家過個溫暖的冬天。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-35","sourceFront":"織","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"大地就像我們的母親一樣，一直保護著我們。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-57","sourceFront":"大地","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那位母親寧可犧牲自己的生命，也要保護孩子的安全。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-10","sourceFront":"寧可","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"母(mother) + 親(close relative) → your closest relative: 母親(mother)."},{"key":"[\"B1L13-3-03\",\"科学\",\"科學\",\"科学\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"語言和科學我都很喜歡。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L13-3-03","sourceFront":"科學","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":1},{"chinese":"月亮上面沒有動物，這是1969年科學的新發現。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L13-2-21","sourceFront":"發現","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有一些研究科學的人，對不科學、無法合理解釋的現象都不太相信。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-12","sourceFront":"科學","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"上帝是不是存在，這是屬於宗教領域的問題，科學家的解釋不一定是正確的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-15","sourceFront":"領域","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"科學家發明了電燈，改變了人類的生活方式，也大大提高了生活品質","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-20","sourceFront":"發明","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"科學家早就證明了氣溫的變化對農業生產有不好的影響，可是到目前還找不到解決的好辦法。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-22","sourceFront":"證明","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"到底上帝存在不存在，科學與宗教的觀點不同，說法也不一樣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-19","sourceFront":"觀點","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這兩家公司在科技方面合作了很多年，也在科學雜誌上發表了共同的研究成果。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-20","sourceFront":"共同","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"著名的科學家愛因斯坦（ Àiyīnsītǎn, Albert Einstein）發明了相對論（Theory of Relativity），這個理論對後來的科學研究產生了重大的影響。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-21","sourceFront":"理論","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"根據目前科學研究的資料，女性與男性在能力、態度和行為等方面的差異都非常小。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-41","sourceFront":"男性","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"路教授最近發表的這套跟人體大腦有關的理論，令其他科學家很感興趣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-45","sourceFront":"套","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"科學家在他的時代所努力的結果，都可能會在未來開花結果。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-31","sourceFront":"結果","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"對科學家或藝術家來說，提供他們一個不受限制的工作環境是很重要的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-15","sourceFront":"限制","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天的自然科學課程所介紹的主題是月球的構造。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-25","sourceFront":"月球","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L03-1-45\",\"護照\",\"護照\",\"护照\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我去義大利旅行的時候，不小心把護照弄丟了，我擔心死了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-13","sourceFront":"死","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每次出國時，機場的安全人員都會檢查我們的護照和行李。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-2-10","sourceFront":"檢查","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的錢包丟了，裡面有護照、 信用卡，這件事很要緊，得馬上告訴警察","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-17","sourceFront":"要緊","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"上次出國時，到了機場才發現沒帶護照，這次我絕對不會再忘了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-32","sourceFront":"絕對","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"臺灣護照比以前好用得多，去許多國家旅行都不需要簽證了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-33","sourceFront":"簽證","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"五年前經驗過護照被偷的意外後，每次出國我都把護照放在上衣裡面的口袋。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-23","sourceFront":"經驗","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在你的國家，第一次辦理護照得本人親自去，不能請別人代替嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-04","sourceFront":"本","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"上次我出國旅行時，護照被偷了，幸好導遊通知了當地的外交人員，很快就辦好了新護照。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-33","sourceFront":"導遊","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"國外旅行時隨時攜帶護照、信用卡，可讓你玩得安心又順利。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-04","sourceFront":"攜帶","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L06-1-03\",\"不過\",\"不過\",\"不过\",\"Conj\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"雖然工作很重要，不過身體健康更重要。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-1-03","sourceFront":"不過","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"吉米來臺灣五年了，喜歡這裡的食物和人，不過還不能適應夏天的天氣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-14","sourceFront":"適應","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"因為最近太多人感冒的關係，來上課的同學變少了，我們班不過十個人，就有五個人請假 。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-28","sourceFront":"不過","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"雖然小馬的個子不高，不過籃球打得可好了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-17","sourceFront":"個子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"最近很多人感冒了，不過不必太擔心，只要戴上口罩、別去人多的地方就行了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-20","sourceFront":"行","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小高總是在別人面前表現得很有禮貌，不過回到家就完全變了一個樣子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-11","sourceFront":"面前","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"臭豆腐是臺灣有名的小吃，不過味道很獨特，不是每個人都能接受。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-08","sourceFront":"獨特","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人人都渴望浪漫的愛情和幸福的家庭，不過自由自在的單身生活也是不錯的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-29","sourceFront":"愛情","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人人都喜歡薪水高、離家近、輕鬆的工作，不過這往往只是一個夢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-29","sourceFront":"薪水","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我打工的餐廳一到週末就客滿，忙不過來的時候，連老闆的叔叔都得來幫忙。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-33","sourceFront":"忙不過來","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你忙不過來的時候就該找人幫忙，別讓自己累壞了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-09","sourceFront":"該","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個銷售計畫很好，不過得先解決相關費用和推銷人員等現實問題","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-19","sourceFront":"現實","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"幸虧你來幫忙，要不然我一個人絕對忙不過來","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-29","sourceFront":"幸虧","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"儘管這次推銷新產品的活動辦得很順利，顧客的反應也很好，不過還是有需要改進的地方。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-06","sourceFront":"改進","sourceBookId":3,"sourceL