B1L02-1-01","sourceFront":"幾","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我下午有課，中午不回家。","pinyin":"Wǒ xiàwǔ yǒu kè, zhōngwǔ bù huí jiā.","english":"I have class in the afternoon; I am not coming home at noon.","sourceCardId":"B1L02-1-01","sourceFront":"幾","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"a 囗(box) with a 口(mouth) inside → the way back: 回(return)."},{"key":"[\"B3L08-1-25\",\"需要\",\"需要\",\"需要\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"請問我需要吃藥嗎？","pinyin":"Qǐngwèn wǒ xūyào chī yào ma?","english":"Do I have to take any medicine?","sourceCardId":"B1L10-2-01","sourceFront":"咳嗽/咳","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"需(need) + 要(want) → need and want: 需要(to need)."},{"key":"[\"B3L09-1-29\",\"特殊\",\"特殊\",\"特殊\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個手錶你已經戴了快二十年了吧？他對你有甚麼特殊的意義呢？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-29","sourceFront":"特殊","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"每個民族都有自己特殊的風俗習慣，有時候外國人不容易了解。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-17","sourceFront":"風俗","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"龍在中國人的心目中具有特殊的地位。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-07","sourceFront":"心目中","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那支軍隊受的是特殊訓練，只在發生重大戰爭時才派出。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-49","sourceFront":"支","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 特(special) and 殊(different): 特殊 means unique."},{"key":"[\"B3L10-1-23\",\"對象\",\"對象\",\"对象\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"佳佳認為談戀愛的對象，年齡不重要，容不容易溝通、個性適不適合才是最重要的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-24","sourceFront":"年齡","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"王小姐用網路交友的方式，找到了理想的結婚對象。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-01","sourceFront":"交友","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"某年某月的某一天，你會找到心中最理想的結婚對象，現在別急。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-21","sourceFront":"某","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小張已經四十歲了，父母盼望他快點找到結婚對象，他卻一點也不著急。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-22","sourceFront":"盼望","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老謝溫柔體貼、聰明英俊，符合我結婚對象的條件，因此我答應嫁給他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-42","sourceFront":"嫁","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 對(correct) and 象(elephant): 對象 means match, boyfriend or girlfriend, marriage partner."},{"key":"[\"B3L16-1-10\",\"访问\",\"訪問\",\"访问\",\"N/V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"歷史系的李教授最近經常接受記者的訪問，因此變得很有名","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-10","sourceFront":"訪問","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"那名記者為了訪問總統外交、貿易等方面的問題，閱讀了許多相關的資料。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-10","sourceFront":"訪問","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"上星期電視臺的人來訪問我們，請我們談談學習華語的經驗。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-22","sourceFront":"電視臺","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L01-1-10\",\"身材\",\"身材\",\"身材\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"要想擁有好身材，除了注意營養，還得多運動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-10","sourceFront":"身材","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"吃了健康食品以後，還是得經常運動才能擁有好身材。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-19","sourceFront":"食品","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"想有效解決身材肥胖的問題，就應避免吃太肥的肉、太油的菜，同時還得多運動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-11","sourceFront":"肥胖","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L05-1-09\",\"罐头\",\"罐頭\",\"罐头\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"食品罐頭吃完以後把罐子洗乾淨，就可以回收了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-09","sourceFront":"罐頭","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L07-2-17\",\"倒不如\",\"倒不如\",\"倒不如\",\"Conj\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那項新產品的設計圖你一個人負責太辛苦了，倒不如找同事一起來做。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-17","sourceFront":"倒不如","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"新型筆電銷售時價格通常比較貴，有時倒不如買符合個人需要的舊型筆電。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-34","sourceFront":"型","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L08-1-44\",\"娛樂\",\"娛樂\",\"娱乐\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"電視臺播出的娛樂節目多半是唱歌跳舞的表演，能讓觀眾心情愉快。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-44","sourceFront":"娛樂","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"工作有壓力時，應適當地分配你的工作及娛樂時間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-25","sourceFront":"分配","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L13-1-35\",\"重复性\",\"重複性\",\"重复性\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這本小說的內容重複性太高，一點新鮮感都沒有。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-35","sourceFront":"重複性","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"密\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A 宓(quiet) 山(mountain) keeps its hidden truth; that stillness is 密(secret)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"曆\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"The 厤(calculate) tracks the 日(sun)'s cycles, and those counted days become 曆(history)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"演唱會\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"演(perform) + 唱(sing) + 會(gathering) → a gathering to perform and sing: a concert."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"闆\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 門(door) holds 品(article) goods high → the shop 闆(boss)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"集\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A 隹(bird) lands on 朩(split wood), and more birds 集(gather)."}]}
